  (text "MCP23018 accepts all 16 pins as inputs. MCP23017 GPA7/GPB7 are output-only.\nADDR tied to GND selects 0x20; tied to VDD selects 0x27. No floating address pins.\nINT outputs unused because firmware polls both input banks. NC pins intentionally open."
